@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@websyner.co",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### --- Employees ---

### List
# @name employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@employeeId = {{employees.response.body.$.data.0._id}}

### Only active
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees?isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees?searchTerm=shadin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create — omit employeeId to auto-generate (WS-001, WS-002, …).
### createLogin provisions a punch-panel account and emails a temp password.
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jahid Hasan",
  "email": "jahid@websyner.co",
  "designation": "Developer",
  "joinDate": "2026-08-01",
  "baseSalary": 4000,
  "perfectBonus": 1000,
  "createLogin": true
}

### Update
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "designation": "Senior Developer",
  "baseSalary": 5000
}

### Deactivate (history is preserved — this is not a delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Punch panel (self-service) ---
### Requires a login linked to an employee record.

### What the panel shows on load
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/me/today
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clock in
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/punch-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clock out
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/punch-out
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Reporting ---

### Today's sheet
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A specific shift date
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/daily?date=2026-08-04
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Monthly report — per employee plus company totals and payroll
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/summary?month=2026-08
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Raw records for one employee
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/records?employee={{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Admin corrections ---

### Add a missing record
# @name record
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee": "{{employeeId}}",
  "shiftDate": "2026-08-04",
  "sessions": [
    { "in": "2026-08-04T16:00:00.000Z", "out": "2026-08-04T19:00:00.000Z" }
  ],
  "note": "Forgot to punch in — confirmed by their lead"
}

### Correct one (times are recalculated from the sessions)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/attendance/records/{{record.response.body.$.data._id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessions": [
    { "in": "2026-08-04T16:00:00.000Z", "out": "2026-08-04T19:30:00.000Z" }
  ],
  "note": "Adjusted after checking the handover notes"
}

### Finalize a day — closes open sessions, marks missing employees absent.
### Also runs automatically at 06:10 in the company timezone.
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/finalize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-08-04"
}

### --- Leave ---

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/leaves
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pending only
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/leaves?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Record
# @name leave
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/leaves
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee": "{{employeeId}}",
  "startDate": "2026-08-17",
  "endDate": "2026-08-18",
  "type": "sick",
  "reason": "Flu"
}

### Approve — excluded from absences, but still blocks the perfect bonus
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/attendance/leaves/{{leave.response.body.$.data._id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved"
}

### --- Settings ---

### Current rules
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update the shift window and rules
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/attendance/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shiftStart": "22:00",
  "shiftEnd": "01:00",
  "overnightCutoff": "06:00",
  "graceMinutes": 10,
  "requiredDailyMinutes": 180,
  "optionalWeekdays": [5, 6],
  "timezone": "Asia/Dhaka",
  "defaultBaseSalary": 4000,
  "defaultPerfectBonus": 1000
}
